casts in quotation text:
  foo[3:n]             [Number 3]
  foo[x:n]             [MNumber x]
  foo["s":n]           refused: Filter_type.BadParamCast(_, "n")
  foo[3:s]             [String 3]
  foo["s":s]           [String s]
  foo[x:s]             [MString x]
  foo[3:t]             [Token 3]
  foo["s":t]           [Token s]
  foo[x:t]             [MToken x]
  foo[3:v]             [Var 3]
  foo["s":v]           [Var s]
  foo[x:v]             [Var x]
  foo[3:l]             [MLevel max(3)]
  foo[x:l]             [MLevel max(0, x)]
  foo[x':l]            [MLevel max(1, x+1)]
  foo[x'':l]           [MLevel max(2, x+2)]
  foo["s":l]           refused: Filter_type.BadParamCast(_, "l")
  foo[x:sh]            [MShape x]
  foo["s":sh]          refused: Filter_type.BadParamCast(_, "sh")
  foo[x:op]            [MOperator x]
  foo[3:op]            refused: Filter_type.BadParamCast(_, "op")
  foo[x:cls]           [MToken x]
  foo[3:cls]           [Token 3]
dest_xparam on base_grammar's terms:
  3              Number 3
  -3             Number -3
  "s"            String s
  i              MString i
  i'             refused: RefineError dest_xparam_exp
  i''            refused: RefineError dest_xparam_exp
  2'             refused: RefineError dest_xparam_exp
  i | j          MLevel max(0, i, j)
  i' | 2         refused: RefineError dest_xparam_exp
  i | 3          MLevel max(3, i)
